#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/btrfs-progs.xml:78
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"lvm2\"/> (<command>dmsetup</command> is used in tests), "
"<xref linkend=\"ntfs-3g\"/>, <xref linkend=\"sphinx\"/> and <xref "
"linkend=\"sphinx_rtd_theme\"/> (required to build documentation), and <ulink"
" "
"url='https://mirrors.edge.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/people/jeffm/reiserfsprogs/'>"
" reiserfsprogs</ulink> (for tests)."
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"lvm2\"/> (<command>dmsetup</command> é usado nos testes), "
"<xref linkend=\"ntfs-3g\"/>, <xref linkend=\"sphinx\"/> e <xref "
"linkend=\"sphinx_rtd_theme\"/> (exigidos para construir documentação) e "
"<ulink "
"url='https://mirrors.edge.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/people/jeffm/reiserfsprogs/'>"
" reiserfsprogs</ulink> (para testes)."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/btrfs-progs.xml:90
#, xml-text
msgid "Kernel Configuration"
msgstr "Configuração do Núcleo"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/btrfs-progs.xml:93
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Enable the following option in the kernel configuration and recompile the "
"kernel:"
msgstr ""
"Habilite a seguinte opção na configuração do núcleo e recompile o núcleo:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/btrfs-progs.xml:101
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"In addition to the above and to the options required for <xref "
"linkend=\"lvm2\"/>, the following options must be set for running tests. The"
" options marked as empty should <emphasis>not</emphasis> be selected because"
" they are for developers and make some tests fail."
msgstr ""
"Além do acima e das opções exigidas para <xref linkend=\"lvm2\"/>, as "
"seguintes opções precisam estar configuradas para executar-se testes. As "
"opções marcadas como vazias <emphasis>não</emphasis> deveriam estar "
"selecionadas porque elas são para desenvolvedores(as) e fazem alguns testes "
"falharem."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/btrfs-progs.xml:112
#, xml-text
msgid "BTRFS Programs"
msgstr "Aplicativos BTRFS"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/btrfs-progs.xml:118
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of btrfs-progs"
msgstr "Instalação do btrfs-progs"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/btrfs-progs.xml:121
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>btrfs-progs</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>btrfs-progs</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/btrfs-progs.xml:125
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr           \\\n"
"            --disable-static        \\\n"
"            --disable-documentation &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr           \\\n"
"            --disable-static        \\\n"
"            --disable-documentation &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/btrfs-progs.xml:131
#, xml-text
msgid "Before running tests, build a support program:"
msgstr "Antes de executar os testes, construa um aplicativo de suporte:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/btrfs-progs.xml:134
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make fssum</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make fssum</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/btrfs-progs.xml:137
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, remove tests that are known to fail. As &root;:"
msgstr "Agora, remova testes que são conhecidos por falharem. Como &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/btrfs-progs.xml:140
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>rm -rf tests/mkfs-tests/042-rootdir-contents\n"
"rm -rf tests/misc-tests/041-subvolume-delete-during-send\n"
"rm -rf tests/fuzz-tests/010-simple-sb</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>rm -rf tests/mkfs-tests/042-rootdir-contents\n"
"rm -rf tests/misc-tests/041-subvolume-delete-during-send\n"
"rm -rf tests/fuzz-tests/010-simple-sb</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/btrfs-progs.xml:145
#, xml-text
msgid "To test the results, issue (as the &root; user):"
msgstr "Para testar os resultados, emita (como o(a) usuário(a) &root;):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/btrfs-progs.xml:148
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>pushd tests\n"
"   ./fsck-tests.sh\n"
"   ./mkfs-tests.sh\n"
"   ./cli-tests.sh\n"
"   ./convert-tests.sh\n"
"   ./misc-tests.sh\n"
"   ./fuzz-tests.sh\n"
"popd</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>pushd tests\n"
"   ./fsck-tests.sh\n"
"   ./mkfs-tests.sh\n"
"   ./cli-tests.sh\n"
"   ./convert-tests.sh\n"
"   ./misc-tests.sh\n"
"   ./fuzz-tests.sh\n"
"popd</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/btrfs-progs.xml:172
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If the above mentioned kernel options are not enabled, some tests fail, and "
"prevent all the remaining tests from running because the test disk image is "
"not cleanly unmounted. Also make sure that the btrfs kernel module is "
"loaded."
msgstr ""
"Se as opções de núcleo mencionadas acima não estiverem habilitadas, alguns "
"testes falharão e impedirão que todos os testes restantes executem, porque a"
" imagem do disco de teste não foi desmontada corretamente. Certifique-se "
"também de que o módulo de núcleo do btrfs esteja carregado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/btrfs-progs.xml:185
#, xml-text
msgid "Install the package as the &root; user:"
msgstr "Instale o pacote como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/btrfs-progs.xml:188
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/btrfs-progs.xml:191
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have passed <parameter>--disable-documentation</parameter> to "
"<command>configure</command> and you need the manual pages, install them by "
"running, as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver passado <parameter>--disable-documentation</parameter> para "
"<command>configure</command> e precisar das páginas de manual, instale-as "
"executando, como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/btrfs-progs.xml:196
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>for i in 5 8; do\n"
"   install Documentation/*.$i /usr/share/man/man$i\n"
"done</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>for i in 5 8; do\n"
"   install Documentation/*.$i /usr/share/man/man$i\n"
"done</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/btrfs-progs.xml:203
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/btrfs-progs.xml:209
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--disable-documentation</parameter>: This switch disables "
"rebuilding the manual pages, because it requires <xref linkend=\"sphinx\"/>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--disable-documentation</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita "
"reconstruir as páginas de manual, porque isso exige <xref "
"linkend=\"sphinx\"/>."

